# Justifications and retirement conditions: docs/en/contributing/dependency-security-policy.md

# Known issue: fast-xml-parser
# Required by AWS SDK v3. Upgrade to v5 breaks functionality.
# Risk is low as input comes from trusted AWS endpoints.
CVE-2026-25128

# Known issue: ip-address (CVE-2026-69192 / GHSA-mwp4-54f8-5fhr)
# Reached only via matrix-appservice-bridge > ip-cidr, and no ip-cidr release runs on a
# patched ip-address: v10 removed bigInteger(), which ip-cidr needs at 20+ call sites.
# Risk is low as the only consumer is ProvisioningApi, which TomoriBot never constructs.
GHSA-mwp4-54f8-5fhr
CVE-2026-69192